<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 72px 20px 72px', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC","Noto Sans SC","PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif' }} notes={`这一页是我最想讲清楚的一页。

五项指标，我一项一项说，并且每一项都标清楚证据是什么。第一项，结构可用率，十二条测试主题全部结构合规，十二比十二。第二项，逐句一致率，一千一百二十比一千一百二十，百分之百——这是把库里三十六期成片全部离线普查一遍得出的，不触发合成、不占显卡，脚本可以随时重跑。第四项，一千字脚本的端到端耗时，稳态口径是五点四到六点二分钟，指标是十分钟，有余量。第五项，峰值显存，两条口径都没过线。

第三项要单独说。MOS 是人听的，我找了三位朋友听完，反馈都是「都没问题」。但我没有让他们填评分表，所以这一项我给不出均分。有的汇报会在这里写一个四点几分出来——那个数我没法复算，我不写。`}>

    {/* A · 标题块 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>五项指标：四项机器算的，一项是人听的</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6E7480', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>03 做到什么程度、还差什么</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6E7480', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                每项都标证据级别：机器证据可当场复跑，人证只能说到「谁听过、听到了什么」
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 10 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.12 }} />
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* B · 内容区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', paddingTop: 22 }}>

        {/* 左栏：巨型锚点 */}
        <Box style={{ width: 600, flexDirection: 'column', paddingRight: 46 }}>

            <Text style={{ fontSize: 96, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9480F', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace', lineHeight: 1 }}>
                1120/1120
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 14 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4B5158', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                逐句一致率 = <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B' }}>100.00%</span>　·　36 期成片离线全量普查，不触发合成、不占 GPU
            </Text>

            <Box style={{ height: 28 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.12 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 24 }} />

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 40 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace', lineHeight: 1 }}>
                        411
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ height: 8 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6E7480', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        项后端回归用例<br />junit 口径，非控制台点阵
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace', lineHeight: 1 }}>
                        35
                    </Text>
                    <Box style={{ height: 8 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6E7480', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        条变异测试<br />全部按预期变红
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        {/* 右栏：五项 */}
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

            <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.12 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 158, fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace' }}>12 / 12</Text>
                <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#15171B' }}>结构可用率</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#6E7480' }}>机器</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 3 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6E7480' }}>门槛 ≥ 80%；12 条测试主题全部结构合规、未命中合规自检</Text>

            <Box style={{ height: 18 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.12 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 158, fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace' }}>1120 / 1120</Text>
                <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#15171B' }}>逐句一致率</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#6E7480' }}>机器</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 3 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6E7480' }}>门槛 = 100%；36 期全量普查，脚本可任意重跑</Text>

            <Box style={{ height: 18 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.12 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 158, fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9480F', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace' }}>无均分</Text>
                <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#15171B' }}>MOS 主观听测</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#D9480F' }}>人证</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 3 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6E7480' }}>3 位真人听完反馈「都没问题」；没有评分表，所以不给数字</Text>

            <Box style={{ height: 18 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.12 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 158, fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace' }}>5.4~6.2 min</Text>
                <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#15171B' }}>1000 字端到端</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#6E7480' }}>机器</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 3 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6E7480' }}>门槛 ≤ 10 min；稳态口径，报数必须标冷启/稳态</Text>

            <Box style={{ height: 18 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#15171B', opacity: 0.12 }} />
            <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
                <Text style={{ width: 158, fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#15171B', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace' }}>3551.7 MiB</Text>
                <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#15171B' }}>峰值显存</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#6E7480' }}>机器</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 3 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6E7480' }}>门槛 3600 / 4200；例外与越线情况见上一页</Text>

            <Box style={{ height: 20 }} />
            <Box style={{ borderLeft: '2px solid #D9480F', paddingLeft: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#15171B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    第三项是人听的，我给不出均分这个数 —— 我不编。
                </Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    {/* C · 页脚条 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 18, height: 2, background: '#D9480F' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6E7480', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>双人对话播客自动生成系统 · 项目答辩</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#6E7480', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Cascadia Mono",Consolas,monospace', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>14 / 17</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
